cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Flood susceptibility in the Swat Basin, Pakistan: spatial validation and
  explanation agreement (code, flood inventory and results)
message: >-
  If you use this software or the flood inventory, please cite both this
  record and the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Muqeet
    family-names: Ahmad
    email: muqeetahmad155@gmail.com
    affiliation: >-
      National Disaster Management Authority (NDMA), Islamabad, Pakistan
abstract: >-
  Code, Google Earth Engine scripts, a two-event (2022, 2025) Sentinel-1
  flood inventory and results for a study of machine-learning flood
  susceptibility mapping in the Swat Basin, Pakistan. Includes random
  forest, XGBoost, LightGBM, a patch CNN and SegFormer models, repeated
  spatial cross-validation, data-source removal tests and an analysis of
  agreement between explanation methods.
keywords:
  - flood susceptibility
  - spatial cross-validation
  - explainable AI
  - Sentinel-1
  - convolutional neural network
  - Pakistan
license: MIT
version: 2.0.0
date-released: '2026-10-12'
